# AI Resume Analyzer v2 — Revised Project Plan

> **University Project — 3.2 Semester**
> Revised: September 28, 2026

---

## 🎯 Project Vision

**CareerLens AI** — Upload your CV, and our AI-powered system analyzes it using NLP, identifies your top 5 matching job categories in the Bangladesh market, shows detailed per-category analysis, and surfaces real job listings from BDJobs.com with application links, company info, and everything you need to land the job.

### System Flow
```
User → Upload CV (PDF) → NLP Parsing & Analysis → AI Job Matching →
→ Top 5 Job Categories Dashboard →
  → Per-Category Analysis (skills match, gaps, recommendations)
  → Per-Category Job Listings (scraped from BDJobs.com)
  → Application Links, Company Info, Job Requirements
→ Downloadable PDF Report
→ Analysis History (saved to user account)
```

