### 6. BDJobs.com Scraper

| Feature | Detail |
|---------|--------|
| **Target** | BDJobs.com — Bangladesh largest job portal |
| **Method** | BeautifulSoup4 + requests with proper headers |
| **Data Extracted** | Job title, company, location, salary, deadline, description, requirements, apply link, company URL |
| **Caching** | Redis cache with 6-hour TTL (avoid excessive scraping) |
| **Rate Limiting** | Max 1 request/second, respectful scraping with delays |
| **Categories** | Map BDJobs categories to our taxonomy |
| **Fallback** | If scraping fails, show cached results with "last updated" timestamp |

> [!WARNING]
> **Legal Consideration**: BDJobs.com robots.txt and Terms of Service must be checked. If scraping is restricted, we will implement one of these fallbacks:
> - Use BDJobs RSS feeds (if available)
> - Manual job data entry (for demo purposes)
> - Use a proxy job search API
>
> For the university project demo, having a cached dataset of 100-200 real jobs is sufficient.

