## 🛡 Edge Cases and Error Handling

| Scenario | Handling |
|----------|----------|
| CV is a scanned image (not text PDF) | Detect low text extraction, show error "Please upload a text-based PDF" |
| CV has no relevant skills | Show analysis with low scores + recommend skill-building resources |
| BDJobs scraper fails | Fall back to cached data, show "last updated" timestamp |
| BDJobs has no jobs for a category | Show "No current openings — check back later" + suggest alternative categories |
| User uploads non-PDF | Client-side validation rejects before upload |
| Very short CV (under 50 words extracted) | Show warning "CV seems too short for meaningful analysis" |
| Network error during analysis | Retry mechanism + clear error message |
| Gemini API rate limit hit | Queue request + show "Analysis in progress, please wait" |

